WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.22 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Test your model before you scale

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Test your riskiest income assumption small, with a decision rule, before committing.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write the assumption as a hypothesis you could disprove.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Set evidence, a threshold, an owner and a date.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Record bad results and change the plan accordingly.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: offer dive operators one season of sponsorship; if none pays US$1,000 by 31 January, plan without them.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You design one small test for your resource model.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
